{"unit_id":"tag:08UE:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节使用朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）来进行少量形变理论（deformation theory）的讨论。我们从一阶加厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0001> 开始，这是带环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的加厚。记 <MATH_0002>，并将 <MATH_0003> 与 <MATH_0004> 的底层拓扑斯（topoi）等同。此外，假设给定带环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>-模（module）<MATH_0007> 以及映射（map）<MATH_0008>，这是 <MATH_0009>-模（modules）的层（sheaves）的映射。本节的问题是能否找到一个对象填入下图的问号处\n<MATH_0010>，以及解（solution）（若存在）在多大程度上唯一。更精确地，我们寻找一阶加厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0011>，以及加厚（thickenings）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>，如（<REF_0001>）所述，其中 <MATH_0013> 与 <MATH_0014> 等同，使 <MATH_0015> 诱导给定映射（map）<MATH_0016>。我们称 <MATH_0017> 为（<REF_0002>）的一个 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>解（solution）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形"},{"source_term":"deformation theory","target_term":"形变理论"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形","context":"本节的工具。"},{"source_term":"deformation theory","target_term":"形变理论","context":"本节主题。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"给定与所求加厚。"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"加厚的对象。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"底层对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯的态射","context":"给定底层态射。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定模。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"理想层的映射。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"模的层。"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解","context":"所求提升。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"加厚","context":"所求态射对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"加厚之间。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08UG:statement","translation":"假设给定带环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）的态射（morphisms）的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>，其水平（horizontal）箭头为一阶加厚（first order thickenings）。令 <MATH_0002>，并假设给定 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0004>，产生交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0005>，其前面和后面均为（<REF_0001>）的解（solutions）。（朝北偏西北的箭头是 <MATH_0006> 上的映射（maps），此处先对源对象应用 <MATH_0007>。）\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 存在典范的（canonical）元素（element），属于\n<MATH_0008>，其为零是存在带环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）\n<MATH_0009>\n填入（<REF_0002>）并与 <MATH_0010> 相容的充要条件。\n<STRUCT_0003> 如果存在态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0011>\n填入（<REF_0003>）并与 <MATH_0012> 相容，则所有这样的态射（morphisms）的集合（set）是\n<MATH_0013>\n作用下的主齐性空间（principal homogeneous space）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯","context":"图的对象。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"图的箭头及所求态射。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"给定立体图。"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平","context":"箭头方向。"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"水平箭头。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"理想层视作模。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"理想层的相容映射。"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解","context":"图的前后面。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"逆像后层映射。"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的","context":"障碍元素。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Ext 障碍。"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"带环拓扑斯的态射","context":"所求填图态射。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"填图态射。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"所有相容态射的集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间","context":"Hom 群作用。"}],"notes":["remark：原文 morphisms ringed topoi 疑缺 of，There exist a canonical element 的主谓数不一致；候选保留数学含义。"]}
